notes.content:
Hi, everyone!

Working on the next chapters of the game, we have changed its beginning a lot too. So we decided to update the demo to bring you the latest up-to-date content and let you see how the game will be played on release!

[previewyoutube=ng8fWdDVXXE;full][/previewyoutube]

[h2]Short Changelog[/h2]
[list]
[*]Updated forest location, added new mechanics, redesigned old;
[*]Updated Decoration and Post Effects to prettify visuals;
[*]Added more cutscenes, updated old ones;
[*]Tuned Sandman controlling to make it more fun and less buggy;
[*]Updated Tutorials to make it more clear and pretty;
[*]Added displaying the amount of resurrections on Flask;
[*]Added missing sounds;
[*]Made few performance optimizations;
[*]Added a lot of small updates.
[/list]

[h2]What’s next?
[/h2]
We are a team from Ukraine. Due to the war, our pace slowed down a lot, and we lost access to some hardware. But the work continues, and we plan to release the game next year, 2023!
Thank you for staying with us and waiting for the release! We are trying our best to make it as soon as possible!

[h2]P.S.[/h2]
If you are a Streamer or working with Media - contact us (kovnir.alik@gmail.com) and we will give you a key to the game and access to an extended demo with the full first chapter!

[h3]FINALLY!!![/h3]
We finished a new version of the demo and almost ready to show it to you! 🎉

It will be this [b]Sunday, November 8[/b] - subscribe to the event in order not to miss it and be the first, who will play the new Demo!

[h3]Short Changelog:[/h3]
☠️ Added an introductory cutscene and several small ones during the game;
☠️ Added main antagonist - Morpheus;
☠️ Added narrative cards which tell the child's story;
☠️ Added the ability to collect items from the child's room;
☠️ Improved weapon models, added sounds where they were missing;
☠️ Updated the Sandman's model, now his texture isn't dirty, he has the outlines of the face, and his cloak and hair have become physical;
☠️ Fixed a lot of bugs, new ones created (if you will find - let us know);
☠️ Made control more convenient;
☠️ A lot of small updates.

Also, we created our own ➡️[url=https://discord.gg/eraxzJB]Discord[/url] ⬅️server. 
Join us, we publish the game development's updates there.

We are waiting for your feedback after playing! It is very important for us to make the game better. 
Don't forget to wishlist the game! See you! 

